"записи (идентификатор добавляется автоматически, если его нет среди "
"запрошенных атрибутов) в формате, заданном **outputType**."
msgstr "The message body is replaced with a list. If **attributes** is not specified, the list elements are string references to the found records. If it is specified, they are the attributes of each record (the identifier is added automatically if it is not among the requested attributes), in the format set by **outputType**."

